@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Feature Specification: Hourly Rental
+
+**Input**: "Let customers rent by the hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice`; a rental shorter than a day starting and ending on the hour costs hourlyPrice per hour. No hourlyPrice means no hourly rental."
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: `addEquipment` accepts optional `hourlyPrice` (non-negative integer euro cents).
+- **FR-002**: A period under 24h, start and end on the hour (UTC), costs hours x hourlyPrice; no 10% discount.
+- **FR-003**: Hourly quote/book for an item without hourlyPrice is refused.
+- **FR-004**: Periods of a day or more still need midnight start/end and use the daily price.
+- **FR-005**: Overlap and availability work on the exact times.
+
+## Assumptions (no one to ask; settled by default)
+- A sub-day period may cross midnight. Exactly 24h midnight-to-midnight is a daily rental.
+- A period of 24h or more not at midnight is refused.
+
+## Plan / Tasks
+Change `src/rental.ts` (period parsing, pricing, validation), add a test, update README. All done.
